--- !u!1001 &347335812
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: A few days later...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "And now, today\u2019s person in the spotlight."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: A former factory worker has transformed into a successful entrepreneur,
        drawing attention across the industry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "His approach to management, centered on the new concept of \u201Crobot
        rights\u201D\nand transforming working conditions, has earned high praise
        across the industry."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: He is also said to be expanding his business by continuing to invest
        in new fields.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: Once an unknown worker, he now influences the lives of countless people
        on his own.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: 'And now, our next story: amid the ongoing heatwave, cases of robot
        overheating have been reported...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 824003791931595992, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[7]'
      value: "<Ending 4/4 \u2014 Fourth Ending: Escape>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "\uC624\uB298\uC758 \uD654\uC81C\uC758 \uC778\uBB3C\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "\uACFC\uAC70 \uD55C \uC81C\uC870\uC5C5\uCCB4\uC758 \uC0DD\uC0B0 \uD604\uC7A5\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uADFC\uBB34\uD588\uB358 \uD55C \uC778\uBB3C\uC774 \uD604\uC7AC\uB294 \uC131\uACF5\uD55C
        \uAE30\uC5C5\uAC00\uB85C \uBCC0\uC2E0\uD574 \uC5C5\uACC4\uC758 \uC8FC\uBAA9\uC744
        \uBC1B\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\uD2B9\uD788 \uC0C8\uB86D\uAC8C '\uB85C\uBD07\uAD8C'\uC744 \uB0B4\uC138\uC6CC
        \uADFC\uB85C \uD658\uACBD\uC744 \uD601\uC2E0\uD55C \uADF8\uC758 \uACBD\uC601
        \uBC29\uC2DD\uC740 \uC5C5\uACC4\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4 \uB192\uC740 \uD3C9\uAC00\uB97C
        \uBC1B\uACE0 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: "\uADF8\uB294 \uD604\uC7AC\uB3C4 \uC0C8\uB85C\uC6B4 \uBD84\uC57C\uC5D0
        \uC9C0\uC18D\uC801\uC73C\uB85C \uD22C\uC790\uD558\uBA70 \uC0AC\uC5C5 \uC601\uC5ED\uC744
        \uD655\uC7A5\uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uB294 \uAC83\uC73C\uB85C \uC54C\uB824\uC84C\uB294\uB370\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: "\uD55C\uB54C \uC774\uB984 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC0DD\uC0B0\uC790\uC600\uB358
        \uD55C \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774, \uC774\uC81C\uB294 \uD640\uB85C \uC218\uB9CE\uC740
        \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC758 \uC0B6\uC5D0 \uC601\uD5A5\uC744 \uBBF8\uCE58\uAC8C
        \uB41C \uAC83\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: "\uB2E4\uC74C \uC18C\uC2DD\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4, \uC774\uC5B4\uC9C0\uB294
        \uD3ED\uC5FC\uC73C\uB85C \uB85C\uBD07 \uACFC\uC5F4 \uD604\uC0C1\uC774 \uBC1C\uC0DD\uD558\uC5EC
        ..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3421748047100024460, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[7]'
      value: "<Ending 4/4 \u2014 \uB124 \uBC88\uC9F8 \uC5D4\uB529: \uD0C8\uCD9C>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4981826221709989368, guid: a761002cc3baef241a528a728e2c6237, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
